---
kind: scene
id: main.prologue
title: "Prologue: The Last Star"
on: newGame
once: user
---

## The dark

@narrator{code="0010"}: There used to be ten thousand stars. The Hollow King ate them, one by one, until only a handful were left.
@lumi{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Oh! You're awake! You're the Wishkeeper, right? Please say you're the Wishkeeper.
<branch id="prologueName" prompt="A small star is hovering an inch from your nose.">
  <choice id="yes" label="I'm the Wishkeeper.">
    @lumi{code="0020" emotion="happy"}: I knew it! I'm Lumi. I'm a star. A small one. I'm your guide!
  </choice>
  <choice id="who" label="Who's asking?">
    @lumi{code="0030" emotion="smug"}: The last free star in the sky, that's who. Lumi. Pleased to meet you. You're the Wishkeeper.
  </choice>
</branch>

## The well

@lumi{code="0040"}: This is the Wishing Well. Throw in a wish, and a hero who fell with the stars climbs out.
@lumi{code="0050"}: Your first one's free. Go on!
::openBanner{banner="standard"}
::set{user.tutorialDone = true}
@lumi{code="0060" emotion="happy"}: When you're ready, the road to the Hollow Keep starts at the first stage.
